---

<section id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg">
    <img src="/krishna.png" alt="শ্রীকৃষ্ণ" class="krishna-img" />
  </div>
  <div class="hero-overlay"></div>
  <div class="hero-content">
    <div class="krishna-portrait">
      <img src="/krishna.png" alt="শ্রীকৃষ্ণ" />
    </div>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">শ্রী রাধা কৃষ্ণের প্রণাম</p>
    <h1 class="hero-title">শ্রীশ্রীকৃষ্ণের অষ্টোত্তর শতনাম</h1>
    <div class="hero-divider">
      <span class="line"></span>
      <span class="om">❁</span>
      <span class="line"></span>
    </div>
    <p class="hero-description">
      ১০৮ নাম, চৌত্রিশ পদাবলী ও শুক শারীর দ্বন্দ্ব —
      <br />
      ভক্তি ভরে শ্রীকৃষ্ণের নাম সংকীর্তন
    </p>
    <a href="#ashtottara" class="hero-cta">পড়তে শুরু করুন ↓</a>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 100vh;
    height: 100vh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, #431407 0%, #1a0a05 100%);
  }

  .hero-bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .krishna-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    opacity: 0.35;
    filter: blur(2px) saturate(1.1);
  }

  .hero-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 1;
    background: linear-gradient(
      180deg,
      rgba(26, 10, 5, 0.7) 0%,
      rgba(67, 20, 7, 0.5) 40%,
      rgba(26, 10, 5, 0.85) 100%
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    padding: 2rem;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .krishna-portrait {
    width: 160px;
    height: 160px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 4px solid var(--gold);
    box-shadow:
      0 0 30px rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.4),
      0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    animation: glow 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }

  .krishna-portrait img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  @keyframes glow {
    from {
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.3), 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    to {
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(212, 160, 23, 0.6), 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
  }

  .hero-subtitle {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--gold-light);
    text-shadow: 0 2px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-divider {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
  }

  .hero-divider .line {
    height: 2px;
    width: 60px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--gold), transparent);
  }

  .hero-divider .om {
    color: var(--saffron);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-description {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.8rem 2rem;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--saffron), var(--saffron-dark));
    color: white;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.4);
    transition: transform 0.3s, box-shadow 0.3s;
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.5);
  }
</style>
